              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Retainers ride horses and have a hand weapon, light armour and shield. Eastern Shock Cavalry. May have thrusting spear (+3). Serbian and Moldavian retainers may have heavy armour (+1). Serbian retainers may have lance (+4) but then become Shock Cavalry.</characteristic>
