              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Spearmen have a hand weapon, light armour, thrusting spear and shield. Both must be Skirmishers. In Bulgar armies, Spearmen and Archers, and Peasants and Skirmishers, may form Combined Formations with up to 50% missile troops.</characteristic>
